<title>AUSTRIA: V&amp;N Q1 group pretax swings into black.</title>
<headline>V&amp;N Q1 group pretax swings into black.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vogel &amp; Noot Holding AG (V&amp;N) on Tuesday reported a first quarter pretax profit of seven million schillings after a loss of 26 million in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Sales climbed to 960 million schillings against 859 million in the year-ago period. Operating profit rose to 39 million after just three million, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
